Third-party material in den_net

lib/src/wordlist.dart

The 2048-word list used for spoken pairing codes and matching words is the English word list
of Bitcoin Improvement Proposal 39 (BIP-39), by Marek Palatinus, Pavol Rusnak, Aaron Voisine
and Sean Bowe: https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt

It is included unchanged, one word per entry, in its original order. The file's SHA-256 (each
word followed by a newline) is
2f5eed53a4727b4bf8880d8f3f199efc90e58503646d9ff8eff3a2ed3b24dbda, and test/crypto_test.dart
checks it.

